  "sourceTitle": "Lemon Or Orange Concentrate Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Lemon Or Orange Concentrate Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 12:20am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 cups flour\n1 cup sugar\n2 sticks butter\n1/2 can lemon concentrate, frozen\n2 eggs\n1 teaspoon soda\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend all ingredients until smooth. Bake at 400 degrees for 8 minutes. After taking them out of oven and while still warm, use the rest of the frozen concentrate on top of the cookies, using a spoon.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "3 cups flour"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 cup sugar"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 sticks butter"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1/2 can lemon concentrate, frozen"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "2 eggs"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 teaspoon soda"
